/Keywords (CES…National Benchmark Article, BLS Establishment Survey National Estimates Revised to\r\nIncorporate March 2013 Benchmarks, With the release of January 2014 data on February 7, 2014, the Bureau of Labor Statistics \(BLS\) introduced its annual revision of National estimates of employment, hours, and earnings from the Current Employment Statistics \(CES\) monthly survey of nonfarm establishments. Each year, the CES survey realigns its sample-based estimates to incorporate universe counts of employment, a process known as benchmarking.)
